00:54:47,880 --> 00:54:51,580
僕らを嫌って「I」に戻って
Hating "II" and returning to "I",

621
00:54:51,880 --> 00:54:56,080
何回だって間違ってきたよ
we've made mistakes so many times.

622
00:54:56,280 --> 00:55:00,080
消えない後悔と冷めない愛情が
An unforgettable regret and unrelenting affection

623
00:55:00,308 --> 00:55:04,708
想いの冒険を 忘れずに全部言えるかな
Can you recount our adventure of feelings, without forgetting a single detail?

624
00:55:04,808 --> 00:55:07,408
君から聞きたいよ 何回目の僕に出会った?
I want to hear from you: How many times have we met now?

625
00:55:07,408 --> 00:55:10,308
僕は変わりました 新しい君に出会うために
I've changed, to meet the new you.

626
00:55:10,308 --> 00:55:13,108
久しぶりだねって 言えたならここで泣きそうか
If you could say: "Long time no see," I'd probably cry right here.

627
00:55:13,108 --> 00:55:15,208
好きとかって 嫌いとかって
"I love you" or "I hate you"—

628
00:55:15,208 --> 00:55:17,908
何度だって愛を歌う君が 恋しくって嘘じゃない本当だよ また出会おう
You sing of love time and time again. I miss you, and I'm not lying, it's the truth. Let's meet again.

629
00:55:30,938 --> 00:55:40,588
想いの冒険は これからもちゃんと続いていく 3と9に乗って
The adventure of our feelings will continue on properly—riding on 3 and 9,

630
00:55:41,288 --> 00:55:44,888
言葉とか飛び越えちゃって 君も変わりました
leaping past words and all! You've changed too,

631
00:55:48,088 --> 00:55:51,588
新しい誰かに会うために 大人になりました
to meet someone new. I've grown up—

632
00:55:55,088 --> 00:55:57,888
それだけでいいと思えた
and I felt that alone was enough.

633
00:55:58,588 --> 00:56:05,588
好きとかって 嫌いとかって 何度だって愛を歌う君が 恋しくって嘘じゃない本当だよ また出会おう
"I love you" or "I hate you"—you sing of love time and time again. I miss you, and I'm not lying, it's the truth. Let's meet again.

634
00:56:16,888 --> 00:56:19,088
はーい、ということで二回目の誕生日!
Right, so for my second birthday!

635
00:56:19,088 --> 00:56:21,888
みんなとこうやって過ごせて 本当に本当に嬉しいです!
I'm so, so happy we get to spend it together like this!

636
00:56:27,088 --> 00:56:29,088
“恋”をして…バカ。
Falling in love... dummy.

637
00:56:31,088 --> 00:56:33,288
“愛”にして…バカ。
Turning it into love... dummy.

638
00:56:34,588 --> 00:56:41,288
バカでいい この先も ずっとこのままだよ バカ。
It's fine to be dummies from here on out too, staying just like this... dummy.

639
00:56:42,588 --> 00:56:48,888
僕らを“II”を嫌って“I”に戻って 何回だって間違ってきたよ
We hated "ii", came back to "i", and over and over again, we've made mistakes.

640
00:56:49,588 --> 00:56:53,088
消えない後悔と 冷えない愛情が 恋を再起動する
Undying regret and warm affection reboot our love.

641
00:56:55,288 --> 00:57:04,288
ほら“I”を嫌ってまた“II”に戻って “III”になって愛を繋いで行こう
See, we hated "i", came back to "ii" again, then it turned into "iii." Let's go on connecting our love.

642
00:57:04,588 --> 00:57:13,088
言い得たい感情は 伝えたい正解は たったひとつだけ ありがとう
The feelings I want to express, the right answer I want to convey can be summed up in one thing: thank you.

643
00:57:14,088 --> 00:57:25,588
ワンマイ愛を抱きたくないの もっとちゃんと恋にしてよ 妄想感情代償同盟 愛を懐いて理想を号泣んだ 行き場のある愛のメロディーを
I don't want to hold back my love, make it proper romance instead! Delusion, emotion, compensation alliance—clasping love and crying out for ideals, give us a melody of love that has somewhere to go!

644
00:57:26,088 --> 00:57:31,088
今これまでにもありがとう
Thank you for everything up until now.

645
00:57:31,088 --> 00:57:41,088
いつでも君と「こんな歌あったね」って 出会いを見数えられるように
So that whenever we say "There was a song like that," we can count all our meetings!

